id: pm-context-ax7z
title: Focus context packs on changed and explicit files
description: "Select and rank linked work from the real Git working set or repeated explicit paths, explain file matches and unlinked changes, and preserve existing neighborhood and packing behavior."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-16T16:03:52.838Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-16T16:30:30.820Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-16T16:04:05.107Z",codex-agent,"Implement real Git discovery with sanitized Git environment, repository-relative matching, overlap/status/priority ordering, read-only file-focused commands, and matching diagnostics across output formats. Validate real trackers and Git repositories, then prove regressions fail when selection functions are reverted."
  "2026-10-16T16:11:53.764Z",codex-agent,"Real installed-CLI testing found that the SDK list path creates metadata-cache files while reading. File-focused requests now enumerate registered type folders with the SDK canonical item reader, reject unreadable or duplicate documents, and skip receipts/serving events. Full tracker-byte snapshots enforce this observational contract. Optional base syntax uses the pinned host command argument contract; repeated files preserve commas and spaces."
  "2026-10-16T16:15:28.747Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: replaced only buildContextPack with its origin/main implementation and rebuilt dist. node --test --test-name-pattern=\"explicit repeated files|linked directories rank|renames match|empty focus stays\" test/file-focus.test.ts failed 4/4 assertions (zero passes). Restored the implementation and rebuilt before positive verification. This proves file filtering, overlap ranking, rename selection and empty-set selection depend on the implementation."
  "2026-10-16T16:20:29.139Z",codex-agent,Positive PM-linked run passed 13/13 with zero failures/skips. The first release gate passed all 340 functional tests but correctly rejected three uncovered explanation branches for neighbors without file matches. Added that source-path scenario. A real installed extension type exposed a reader enumeration gap; its regression failed before passing the active extension registry into the SDK type resolver. Thresholds and SDK pins remain unchanged.
  "2026-10-16T16:30:29.313Z",codex-agent,"Final local verification: npm run release:check, bun run release:check, and env HOME=$(mktemp -d) GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check each passed 341/341 tests with zero failures, cancellations or skips. Native coverage is 100% lines/branches/functions; c8 is 100% statements/lines/functions and 99.92% branches at unchanged thresholds. PM-linked focused verification passed 14/14 with zero failures/skips. Tracker validation passed. Existing c8 non-Error exception branch remains outside this feature; file-focus.ts has 100% coverage in all reported dimensions. Ready for PR checks; item remains in progress."
